 * Builds the installable SQL files from PHP definitions:
 *   install/seed.sql         core data every store needs (roles, settings, pages, shipping, gateways, homepage)
 *   install/sample-data.sql  demo catalogue (categories, products, variants, images, collections, slides…)
 *   install/database.sql     schema + seed + sample data in ONE file for phpMyAdmin import
 *
